 class=\"bullet-text\">No loud beeping, so you wake up calm</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"bullet-item\">\n    <svg class=\"check-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n      <defs>\n        <linearGradient id=\"grad3\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\">\n          <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0f2540\"/>\n          <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#3d6fb5\"/>\n        </linearGradient>\n      </defs>\n      <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"12\" fill=\"url(#grad3)\"/>\n      <path d=\"M7 12.5L10.2 15.5L17 8.5\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    </svg>\n    <span class=\"bullet-text\">Lasts 14 days on one charge</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
