        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .pf-section {\n    max-width: 800px;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 16px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .pf-header {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n  .pf-title {\n    font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 40px);\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .pf-subtitle {\n    font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 16px);\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  .pf-list {\n    border: 1px solid #e2e2e2;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .pf-item {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e2e2;\n  }\n  .pf-item:last-child {\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n  .pf-question {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 12px;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 16.5px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .pf-plus {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    width: 15px;\n    height: 15px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .pf-plus::before,\n  .pf-plus::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    transition: transform 0.25s ease;\n  }\n  .pf-plus::before {\n    top: 0; left: 50%;\n    width: 2px; height: 100%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n  }\n  .pf-plus::after {\n    top: 50%; left: 0;\n    width: 100%; height: 2px;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n  }\n  .pf-item.active .pf-plus::before {\n    transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(90deg);\n    opacity: 0;\n  }\n  .pf-answer {\n    max-height: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    transition: max-height 0.3s ease;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n  }\n  .pf-item.active .pf-answer {\n    max-height: 300px;\n    padding-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .pf-answer p {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: clamp(13px, 1.8vw, 15px);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #444;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"pf-section\">\n  <div class=\"pf-header\">\n    <div class=\"pf-title\">FAQs</div>\n    <div class=\"pf-subtitle\">Most common questions answered, no fluff just straight facts.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pf-list\">\n    <div class=\"pf-item\">\n      <div class=\"pf-question\">\n        <span>Will this actually wake me up?</span>\n        <span class=\"pf-plus\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pf-answer\">\n        <p>Yes. Onyx is built for heavy sleepers who sleep through phone alarms and sound-based clocks. It uses strong vibration on your wrist instead of noise, and your brain can't tune that out the way it can with sound. The vibration starts light and gradually increases in intensity until you wake up.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-item\">\n      <div class=\"pf-question\">\n        <span>Will it wake up my partner too?</span>\n        <span class=\"pf-plus\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pf-answer\">\n        <p>No. Onyx wakes only you. There's no sound at all, just a silent vibration on your wrist that only you can feel. Your partner can sleep straight through it while you get up on time.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-item\">\n      <div class=\"pf-question\">\n        <span>How do I set it up?</span>\n        <span class=\"pf-plus\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pf-answer\">\n        <p>No app or phone needed. Set the alarm time directly on the band using the buttons, wear it snug on your wrist while you sleep, and it does the rest. Charging is just as simple, click the included magnetic charger onto the band and plug it in.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-item\">\n      <div class=\"pf-question\">\n        <span>How long does the battery last?</span>\n        <span class=\"pf-plus\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pf-answer\">\n        <p>Up to 14 days on a single charge with normal nightly use. It charges fast over USB, so you're never without it for long.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pf-item\">\n      <div class=\"pf-question\">\n        <span>Is it comfortable to sleep in?</span>\n        <span class=\"pf-plus\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pf-answer\">\n        <p>Yes. Onyx is designed with a soft, breathable strap made for all-night wear. It's lightweight, water-resistant for daily use, and doesn't feel bulky like a smartwatch.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.pf-question').forEach(q => {\n    q.addEventListener('click', function() {\n      const item = this.parentElement;\n      const wasActive = item.classList.contains('active');\n      document.querySelectorAll('.pf-item').forEach(i => i.classList.remove('active'));\n      if (!wasActive) item.classList.add('active');\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>",
